--TEST--
"integrated_javascripts" prepend javascript
--DEPRECATION--
Since twig/twig 3.12: The "tag" constructor argument of the "Integrated\Bundle\AssetBundle\Twig\Node\AssetNode" class is deprecated and ignored (check which TokenParser class set it to "integrated_javascripts"), the tag is now automatically set by the Parser when needed.
Since twig/twig 3.12: The "tag" constructor argument of the "Integrated\Bundle\AssetBundle\Twig\Node\AssetNode" class is deprecated and ignored (check which TokenParser class set it to "integrated_javascripts"), the tag is now automatically set by the Parser when needed.
--TEMPLATE--
{% integrated_javascripts mode='append'
    'script2.js' %}
{% endintegrated_javascripts %}

{% integrated_javascripts mode='prepend'
    'script.js' %}
{% endintegrated_javascripts %}

{{ integrated_javascripts() }}
--DATA--
return array()
--EXPECT--
<script type="text/javascript" src="/script.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript" src="/script2.js"></script>
